        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Sometimes, bad guys make the best good guys&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mastermind, Hitter, Hacker, Grifter, Thief&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Leverage fusion!&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
